# LF in the repository and in the working tree for every text file. Go sources
# fall under the default; a test fixture there holds raw control bytes, so *.go
# is left to Git's own text detection instead of being forced to text.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.ans text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
